    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d119">

                <pb facs="0165" n="115" xml:id="pg115"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jernigan to Mr. Denby.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-25"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 25,
                            1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Arrested on concession, peacefully and openly engaged away from seat of war; not
                    a Japanese soldier on Chinese soil at the time. Mere schoolboys. China can well
                    afford to have us keep them secure.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jernigan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
